# DECISIONS.log — append-only ADRs

## ADR-0001 … ADR-0011
See earlier entries: PixiJS renderer, fixed 60Hz sim, JSON content, door mats,
gesture-gated audio, pure engine modules, renderer-owned ambience, A* grid
pathfinding, seekers sharing the pathfinder, pure mini-game cores, top-down
interiors.

## ADR-0012: Story content as validated data — 2026-08-08
Context: prototype dialogue/cutscenes were inline strings with no way to
check for dead branches. Decision: cutscenes.json + dialogue-trees.json hold
all story content; a validator (tests/dialogue.test.ts) proves no choice
points to a missing node.
Consequences: writers edit JSON; CI fails on dead dialogue nodes.

## ADR-0013: Overlays pause the sim through one flag — 2026-08-08
Context: dialogue, cutscenes, mini-games, and pause all need to freeze the
world without fighting each other. Decision: a single overlayOpen flag in
World; any overlay sets it, sim early-returns while true.
Consequences: no double-pause bugs; one place to reason about sim freezing.
